  "description": "In an era where youth unemployment has reached 1 million, Jung Jinho is a jobless man with zero qualifications. “Come work at my company.” After receiving an unexpected offer from the CEO of a securities firm, who used to be the guild master of the same game he played, he is thrown into the world of society. And there, Jung Jinho’s special ability awakens. With just one click of the mouse, billions of won move. The legend of a crazy stock genius who sweeps up all the money in the financial world begins!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
